{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>青衣發生撞船意外。早上(27日)9時25分，警方接報指一艘由上環開往蛇口客輪，在青衣油庫對開海面，懷疑撞及船塢設施，船上至少24人受傷，其中4人較為嚴重。船隻目前被拖往友聯船廠，等待救援人員處理傷者，消防派出共15輛救護車及流動醫療車趕赴現場。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T03:23:55.047567+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T02:55:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T03:17:29.663144+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T03:17:29.663144+00:00","content_hash":"68a610089b19793d9ba035644845cd690518b4fd7217562c4b01d8830d0b90c1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}